# Always push

After finishing requested work in this repo, create a git commit (if there are relevant changes) and `git push origin HEAD` without asking first.

Do not commit secrets, `.env`, lockfile hand-edits, `test-results/`, or unrelated untracked files. Use the existing commit-message style. Never force-push to main.
